# AFS Cursor Rule

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `BRAIN.md`, `VISION.md`, `LOOPS.md`, and `TASTE.md` when
  relevant before changing behavior, product direction, or subjective quality.
- Put external source material in `sources/`.
- Do not create `official-documentation/`.
- Keep large root-style Markdown files out of `context/`.
- Prefer updating durable AFS files over burying reusable context in chat.
